    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Synopsis</strong>:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After outlasting your encounters with <strong><i>Amon Morgan</i></strong> and <strong><i>Blair Cunningham</i></strong> (<i>from Umbra</i>), you were forced to leave what was supposed to be one of the last &quot;safe spaces&quot; worldwide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414850/extras/5798b91e6bad5118b1cbe549dcc2a7da.avif?t=1735203737\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now it's time to face the horrors of the outside, but you're not alone this time.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Laura Levi</i></strong>, an ex-soldier, taking refuge among the horrors of the outside, will be a helpful companion when facing no less than the end of the world as we know it.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The World:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rules have changed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our home has become a desolate wasteland, taken over by <strong>Lost</strong> individuals.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lost:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;A human suffering from <strong><i>UPT</i></strong> (<i>Umbra Post-Trauma</i>)&quot;\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>UPT</i></strong> individuals suffer from <i>extreme\u00a0dissociation</i>. This removes all limits the brain imposes on us (e.g.: Rotating your eyes in impossible ways, running with no feeling of getting tired, and losing social interests).\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Never try to interact with a <strong>Lost</strong> individual.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414850/extras/d4802bb518431d2c8c05c21143d61948.avif?t=1735203737\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new take on the <i>survival-horror</i> genre.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game goes in a new direction gameplay-wise, developing a bond with <strong><i>Laura</i></strong>, and together finding ways to fight your fates, with an interesting cinematic touch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging enemies with a competent AI</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Great variation of objectives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deep, dramatic, and original story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric and profound soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(and much more...)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Synopsis</strong>:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After outlasting your encounters with <strong><i>Amon Morgan</i></strong> and <strong><i>Blair Cunningham</i></strong> (<i>from Umbra</i>), you were forced to leave what was supposed to be one of the last &quot;safe spaces&quot; worldwide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414850/extras/5798b91e6bad5118b1cbe549dcc2a7da.avif?t=1735203737\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now it's time to face the horrors of the outside, but you're not alone this time.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Laura Levi</i></strong>, an ex-soldier, taking refuge among the horrors of the outside, will be a helpful companion when facing no less than the end of the world as we know it.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The World:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rules have changed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our home has become a desolate wasteland, taken over by <strong>Lost</strong> individuals.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lost:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;A human suffering from <strong><i>UPT</i></strong> (<i>Umbra Post-Trauma</i>)&quot;\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>UPT</i></strong> individuals suffer from <i>extreme\u00a0dissociation</i>. This removes all limits the brain imposes on us (e.g.: Rotating your eyes in impossible ways, running with no feeling of getting tired, and losing social interests).\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Never try to interact with a <strong>Lost</strong> individual.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414850/extras/d4802bb518431d2c8c05c21143d61948.avif?t=1735203737\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new take on the <i>survival-horror</i> genre.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game goes in a new direction gameplay-wise, developing a bond with <strong><i>Laura</i></strong>, and together finding ways to fight your fates, with an interesting cinematic touch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging enemies with a competent AI</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Great variation of objectives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deep, dramatic, and original story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric and profound soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(and much more...)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
